{"title":"Git 日志","date":"2024-10-04T16:00:00.000Z","toc":false,"summary":"","source":"_posts/软件测试/工具流/Git/Git_日志.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Git 日志\ntags: [Git, 工具相关]\nsummary: \"\"\ntoc: false\ncopyright: \"\"\ndate: 2024-10-05\n---\n\n## 日志\n\n### 查看\n\n```bash\ngit log\n```\n\n### 简化版日志\n\n```bash\ngit log --pretty=oneline\n```\n\n### 查看前N条  \n\n```bash\ngit log -n\n```\n\n### 变更日志\n\n`-n` 同上,不加则显示全部\n\n```bash\ngit log --stat -n\n```\n\n### 查看提交修改\n\n查看某次commit做了哪些修改\n\n```bash\ngit show <commit-hash-id>\n```\n\n### 退出log状态\n\n有时候日志过长，可以按下英文q退出状态\n\n### 查看HEAD指向历史和说明\n\n```bash\ngit reflog\n```\n","slug":"软件测试/工具流/Git/Git_日志","published":true,"updated":"2024-10-04T16:00:00.000Z","_id":"cmcg7o5xt002hprqb2oyc3hlf","comments":true,"layout":"post","photos":[],"html":"<h2 id=\"日志\"><a href=\"#日志\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"日志\"></a>日志</h2><h3 id=\"查看\"><a href=\"#查看\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"查看\"></a>查看</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git <span class=\"built_in\">log</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"简化版日志\"><a href=\"#简化版日志\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"简化版日志\"></a>简化版日志</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git <span class=\"built_in\">log</span> --pretty=oneline</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"查看前N条\"><a href=\"#查看前N条\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"查看前N条\"></a>查看前N条</h3><figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">git <span class=\"built_in\">log</span> -n</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"变更日志\"><a href=\"#变更日志\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"变更日志\"></a>变更日志</h3><p><code>-n</code> 同上,不加则显示全部</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight 